{
 "doc": "M4-C13-02 greybox (tools/act1/ch13_greybox.py; do not edit by hand): Ansedra, the holy city on its mirror lagoon at an overcast 16:30 (colour script ch13). The outer moorings (Moorings; kerrid_moorings: Kerrid sits out the nights there among the barge-polers, ADR 0022 (c)), a causeway north to the central island and Sefir's house (sefir_door), west to Corran's old house (corran_house: Ysolde's side scene), east to the Lamp Archive (to_archive), north to the Sanctum (to_sanctum); gold bowl-domes. The story waits on the beat sheet (M4-C13-01).",
